<h1>Crate Digger V2</h1>

<p>
  Welcome to Crate Digger V2.
</p>

<p>
  Discover music, save releases you like,
  and share your own ratings and reviews.
</p>

<% if current_user %>
  <h2>Welcome, <%= current_user.username %>!</h2>

  <p>
    Not sure where to begin?
  </p>

  <p>
    Start by searching for a release you know.
    Crate Digger will help you find the correct music information.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "Search for Music", music_search_path %>
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "View My Collection", collection_entries_path %>
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= button_to "Log Out", logout_path, method: :delete %>
  </p>
<% else %>
  <h2>New Here?</h2>

  <p>
    You can look through Crate Digger without an account.
  </p>

  <p>
    To save music, add releases, or write reviews,
    you will need to create a free account first.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "Create an Account", signup_path %>
  </p>

  <p>
    Already have an account?
    <%= link_to "Log In", login_path %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<h2>Browse Crate Digger</h2>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Browse Releases", records_path %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Browse Artists", artists_path %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Browse Genres", genres_path %>
</p>

<% if current_user %>
  <h2>Other Ways to Add Music</h2>

  <p>
    If music search does not find what you need,
    you can enter a release manually.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "Enter a Release Manually", new_record_path %>
  </p>
<% end %>
